Usage:

```tsx
<CheckoutScreen
  items={cartItems}
  currency="USD"
  onBack={() => navigate('/cart')}
  onPay={async (address, total) => {
    await api.createOrder({ address, total });
    navigate('/order-success');
  }}
/>
```

Notes:
- Reads Telegram theme colors via `--tg-theme-*` CSS variables (set those on `<html>`/`<body>` from `Telegram.WebApp.themeParams` at app startup) with sane fallbacks so it still looks right outside Telegram.
- The Telegram `BackButton` is wired up automatically when `window.Telegram.WebApp` is present; a plain "Back to cart" link is always shown too, so it works in any browser.
- Validation runs on blur and on submit; `onPay` is awaited so you can surface async errors (e.g. a failed payment) inline.
